{"resourceIdentifier":"4339","resourceName":"Gansu Baiyin AWMS Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project","description":"Gansu Baiyin AWMS Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project (hereinafter referred to as the grouped project) is a grouped project which installs two new animal waste management systems (AWMSs) to treat the manure from two existing swine farms in Baiyin, Gansu Province. The project is owned and implemented by the subsidiary of Muyuan Foods Co., Ltd. (hereinafter referred to as the project proponent). Each swine farm installs one set of AWMS to treat the manure on site. The purpose of the project activity is to treat the manure and wastewater to avoid methane emissions generated in the baseline uncovered anaerobic lagoons.\r\nThe grouped project is to install AWMS for each subsidiary swine farm and treat the manure generated on site. Each project activity instance under the grouped project will involve the collection and utilization of the biogas generated from AWMS for energy generation, the part of biogas that cannot be utilized will be destructed by flaring.","location":{"latitude":37.320624,"longitude":104.074466},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-07-28","endExclusive":"2023-08-28","endInclusive":"2023-08-27"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4339"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Gansu"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Muyuan Foods Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"55588"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livestock, enteric fermentation, and manure management"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.D."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"21/06/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 30/09/2021 - 29/09/2031"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=88276&IDKEY=qq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhs121732604","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS PD-Gansu Baiyin AWMS Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-04-12T03:17:40.627Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=88095&IDKEY=a0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9a121483005","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor-Gansu Baiyin AWMS Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-04-11T05:48:13.153Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=88275&IDKEY=k0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9o121731225","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS PD-Gansu Baiyin AWMS Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-04-12T03:17:14.277Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=97935&IDKEY=2iquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfd135052365","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"Registration Representation-Gansu Baiyin AWMS Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project-4339.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-09-26T07:31:39.423Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=114628&IDKEY=30e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjf